<section class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__container">

    <header class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__eyebrow">The honest read</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__heading">Where does each one fall short?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__sub">Both are good products. These are the ceilings buyers hit, taken from their own pricing pages and G2 reviews.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__grid">
<article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 14 4-4"/><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__title">Typeform's free plan is a demo</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__body">Ten responses a month. Unlimited typeforms, but you cannot run anything real on it, and Basic only lifts that to 100 a month.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__title">Jotform's paid tiers are single-user</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__body">Every Jotform plan below Enterprise is described as a 1 User Individual Plan. Adding a colleague means an Enterprise conversation.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__title">Typeform gets expensive at volume</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__body">High cost is the top complaint theme in its G2 reviews at 47 mentions, described as prohibitive when scaling. Reaching 1,000 responses a month costs $56.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__card"><div aria-hidden="true" style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:#f7f3ff;border:1px solid #e4d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#6941c6;margin-bottom:14px;"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="14" y="14" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/></svg></div><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__title">Jotform's customization frustrates</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-leave__body">Design and customization friction accounts for 433 mentions across its G2 complaint themes, against Typeform's 21. It is the clearest evidence for Typeform's edge on experience.</p></article>
