    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__grid fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__grid--three">
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card">
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://www.jotform.com&amp;size=64" alt="Jotform logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Jotform</span></h3>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card-note">Every paid tier below Enterprise is a single user</p>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Starter</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">Free</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">5 forms, 100 submissions a month, 100 MB storage, 100 fields per form, 10 signed documents.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Bronze</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$39/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">$34 a month billed annually. 25 forms, 1,000 submissions a month, 1 GB, 250 fields.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Silver</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$49/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">$39 a month billed annually. 50 forms, 2,500 submissions a month, 10 GB, 500 fields.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Gold</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$129/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">$99 a month billed annually. 100 forms, 10,000 submissions a month, 100 GB, and HIPAA.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Enterprise</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">Custom</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Unlimited forms and submissions, multi-user access, custom domain, and a dedicated SOC 2 environment.</p></div></div>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__foot"><strong>Cheaper than Typeform at equal volume.</strong> Bronze includes 1,000 submissions for $34, where Typeform charges $56 for the same.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card">
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://www.typeform.com&amp;size=64" alt="Typeform logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Typeform</span></h3>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card-note">Every tier meters responses per month</p>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Free</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$0</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Unlimited typeforms, 10 responses a month, 1 seat.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Basic</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$39/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">$28 a month billed annually. 100 responses a month included, 1 seat, 1 GB.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Plus</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$79/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">$56 a month billed annually. 1,000 responses a month, 3 seats, 2 GB, custom subdomain.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Business</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$129/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">$91 a month billed annually. 10,000 responses a month, 5 seats, 4 GB.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Enterprise</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">Custom</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Custom limits, 6+ seats, full custom domain, HIPAA, SSO, and data residency.</p></div></div>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__foot"><strong>Cheapest to start, dearest per response.</strong> Basic is $28 but stops at 100 a month, so real volume means Plus.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card--formester">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tag">Our pick</span>
      <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card-brand"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><img src="https://t3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://formester.com&amp;size=64" alt="Formester logo" width="22" height="22" loading="lazy" style="width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;display:block;flex-shrink:0;">Formester</span></h3>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__card-note">No response allowance on any plan, free included</p>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tiers"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Free</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$0/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Unlimited forms, unlimited responses, AI form creator, all field types, quiz auto-scoring, drop-off analysis, payment collection.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Personal</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$13/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Free, plus remove branding, conditional logic and rules, redirect on completion, GTM and GA4, SEO meta tags.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Business</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">$49/mo</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Personal, plus API access, MCP server, PDF exports, 25 team members, real-time collaboration, 50 GB file storage.</p></div><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier"><div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-head"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-name">Enterprise</span><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-cost">Let's Talk</span></div><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__tier-body">Everything in Business, plus custom limits, unlimited webhooks, high-volume file uploads, unlimited signatures, priority support.</p></div></div>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__foot"><strong>Flat price, no volume ceiling.</strong> The $49 tier carries 25 people and unlimited responses, and free has no cap either.</p>
      <a href="https://app.formester.com/users/sign_up" class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__cta">Sign Up Free</a>
    </div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__callout">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__callout-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18h6"/><path d="M10 22h4"/><path d="M15.09 14c.18-.98.65-1.74 1.41-2.5A4.65 4.65 0 0 0 18 8 6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .23 2.23 1.5 3.5A4.61 4.61 0 0 1 8.91 14"/></svg></span>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-pricing__callout-text"><strong>Worth flagging:</strong> compare like for like. Typeform's $28 Basic includes 100 responses a month; Jotform's $34 Bronze includes 1,000. Matching Jotform's volume on Typeform means Plus at $56, so the cheaper-looking product costs about 65% more at the same usage.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </section>

