<section class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick-heading">
  <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__container">

    <header class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__header">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__eyebrow">Why teams switch</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__heading">Where does Formester fit between them?</h2>
      <p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__sub">Four things neither Jotform nor Typeform offers at their entry tiers.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__grid">
<article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 14 4-4"/><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__title">No response allowance at all</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__body">Unlimited responses on every plan, including free. Jotform meters submissions monthly and Typeform meters responses.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__title">A team on the standard plan</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__body">25 members on Business at $49. Jotform's paid tiers below Enterprise are single-user; Typeform gives 3 seats on Plus.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1.5l2 6.9 6.9 2-6.9 2-2 6.9-2-6.9-6.9-2 6.9-2z"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__title">AI that starts from a PDF</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__body">Generate from a prompt, a pasted question list, or a PDF upload, then edit anything the AI drafted.</p></article><article class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__card"><span class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="2" y1="10" x2="22" y2="10"/></svg></span><h3 class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__title">Payments on the free plan</h3><p class="fmstr-cmp-jvt-why-pick__body">Stripe and PayPal fields at $0, with no platform fee on top of the processor's own.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
      </div>
    </section>

